{"id":"vod_sn_39027","vodId":"39027","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"零度战姬","name_cn":"零度战姬","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/896b20fcdd2ecb811c756f462da96231.jpg"},"summary":"青井和哉（市来光弘 配音）是一个善良平凡的少年，姐姐青井和叶（能登麻美子 配音）的死却永远的改变了他将来的道路。袭击和叶的，是一种名叫“NOVA”的异次元体，为了替姐姐报仇，和哉进入了培养与异次元体战斗的战士的专门学校——杰尼提克斯学院。　　在学院中，学员们被分为潘多拉与制御者两种类别，就这样，和哉结识了一群外表柔弱实力却异常强大的女孩子们。其中，被称为最强潘多拉的莎缇莱萨（能登麻美子 配音）最让和哉感到在意，在机缘巧合之下，和哉竟然和她结成了搭档。此外，还有外刚内柔的傲娇娘嘉涅沙（喜多村英梨 配音），神秘的西藏转学生拉娜林沁（花泽香菜 配音）等人。在战斗和学习的过程中，和哉下定决心，一定要揭开姐姐死亡的谜团。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:41","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rGLU5MViF61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BNcvyNRb2t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4zuCjP2HZt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BHHGJDNK421/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/42ewG6Qdti1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/V1zEiwTkYD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CgqPvyrsq71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rDSud6atRr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7xmpKjweJm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/b4PS637y8G1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xL1pAMGc9V1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GZzfb0e8i91/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:51.483Z"}